<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Thank you — PillowPayroll</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --navy: #2C4A7C; --navy-dark: #1C3260; --sky: #6DB5C8;
      --mist: #E8F4F8; --linen: #F7F8FA; --ink: #1C2433;
      --ink-mid: #4A5568; --ink-light: #718096; --border: #E2E8F0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--linen); color: var(--ink);
      min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    nav {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px;
      height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center;
    }
    .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .logo-icon {
      width: 36px; height: 26px; background: var(--navy);
      border-radius: 7px; position: relative;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .logo-icon::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 4px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--sky); border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .logo-icon span { color: white; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .logo-text { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
    .logo-text em { font-style: normal; color: var(--navy); }

    .page {
      flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 64px 32px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px; padding: 56px 48px;
      text-align: center; max-width: 480px; width: 100%;
    }
    .success-icon {
      width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #EBF8EF;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
    }
    .success-icon svg { width: 32px; height: 32px; stroke: #276749; }
    h1 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent;
      color: var(--ink-mid); transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: var(--linen); color: var(--ink); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/demos/pillowpayroll" class="logo">
        <div class="logo-icon"><span>P</span></div>
        <span class="logo-text">Pillow<em>Payroll</em></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="success-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1>We've got your enquiry!</h1>
      <p>Thanks for getting in touch. A member of our team will be in contact within one business day — usually much sooner.</p>
      <a href="/demos/pillowpayroll" class="btn">← Back to PillowPayroll</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- CONFIGR DEMO BANNER -->
  <style>.demo-banner-bar{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1565C0,#0D47A1);position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;padding:10px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;}</style>
  <div class="demo-banner-bar">
    <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:white;">Demo built by <strong>Configr</strong> — free preview of what your website could look like</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#1B2B4B;background:white;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;">Get this website →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:52px;"></div>
</body>
</html>
